  "source_scope": "MPEG-1/2/2.5 Layer III, AAC-LC, and bounded native FLAC frame decoders plus required tables; no encoders, CLI, WASM, resampler, Opus, or Vorbis. The upstream FLAC whole-file helper is excluded with CRISPER_FLAC_FRAME_ONLY.",
